{"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T22:05:35.768Z","evidence":{"commit":"9fc198d72eadf732ffa347e58da30c45223f8c63"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f3-shell"}],"name":"client-side admin role gate","description":"AdminRouteGate composes inside AuthGate; reads session via useAuthSessionRepository, checks session.roles.includes(AUTH_ROLE_ADMIN) from @sfx/shared. Loading skeleton uses aria-busy main + animate-pulse bg-muted. Deny surface uses <main> landmark with localized title/message and Back-to-Home anchor to '/'. Children render only when uiModel.status === 'allowed'.","files":["apps/web/src/features/admin-shell/presentation/components/AdminRouteGate"],"id":"mx-8cea7c"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T22:05:42.825Z","evidence":{"commit":"9fc198d72eadf732ffa347e58da30c45223f8c63"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f3-shell"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"Sidebar active-state for nested routes must compare pathname exactly OR check startsWith with trailing slash. Use pathname === ADMIN_ROUTE OR pathname.startsWith(ADMIN_ROUTE + slash). Naive startsWith on the bare route incorrectly matches sibling routes like administration.","id":"mx-718bb6"}
{"type":"failure","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T23:14:37.682Z","evidence":{"commit":"840d7263f3729d15ab0a5d7a02f0841038b54142"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f4-page"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"description":"useEffect([record, form]) where record = useQuery(...).data + select(mapper) causes infinite re-renders when the mapper creates fresh Date/object references each render. TanStack structuralSharing does not stabilize references when the mapper outputs non-value-equal objects (Dates are reference-compared).","resolution":"Gate form.reset on a primitive signature (id + updatedAt.toISOString()) stored in useRef. Compare current vs last in the effect and bail if equal. Coverage stays at 100%.","id":"mx-d9b182"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T23:14:39.955Z","evidence":{"commit":"840d7263f3729d15ab0a5d7a02f0841038b54142"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f4-page"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"executeRequest error parser must read errorBody.error.message + errorBody.error.errors[] BEFORE the legacy top-level errorBody.message. F2 backend wraps everything in {success,error:{statusCode,message,errors}}. Without envelope-aware parsing the frontend drops per-field validation errors and surfaces generic 'Request failed' messages.","id":"mx-e7eb2d"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T23:14:43.690Z","evidence":{"commit":"840d7263f3729d15ab0a5d7a02f0841038b54142"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f4-page"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"HTML inputs emit '' for empty optional text fields; Zod .strict() schemas with .nullish() rejection require '' to be mapped to null BEFORE PUT/POST. Do the conversion in a valuesForSubmit(values) helper in the page hook, not inside register({setValueAs}) alone — defense in depth keeps form.setValue('field','') paths safe.","id":"mx-27b59b"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-17T01:48:47.356Z","evidence":{"commit":"00978567f2dc4d323dd20b567573f6575fcfbd1b"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f3-tabshell"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"Page-level auth-gate hoist: when multiple /admin/* routes share <AuthGate><AdminRouteGate>, mount the composition once in app/admin/layout.tsx and drop the wrappers from per-page route files. The page keeps its @routeGuard JSDoc comment so the contract compiler still records the leaf-route guard. Layout owns auth boundary; leaf pages stay pure presentation.","id":"mx-f7767b"}
{"type":"pattern","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-17T01:48:56.906Z","evidence":{"commit":"00978567f2dc4d323dd20b567573f6575fcfbd1b"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f3-tabshell"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"name":"Next.js redirect server-handler test","description":"To unit-test a server-side redirect handler in app/route/page.tsx mock next/navigation so redirect throws Error NEXT_REDIRECT: assert the page invocation throws plus assert the mock was called with the expected target path. The thrown error models Next.js server-runtime semantics — redirect never returns. Pattern lives in apps/web/src/app/admin/__tests__/page.test.tsx introduced by F3.","files":[".claude/hooks/no-close-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/no-merge-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/validate-flow-file.js",".claude/settings.json",".claude/skills/feature-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/flow-failure-response/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/product-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/_shared-management.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/bootstrap-and-curate.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/cross-task-flows.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/failure-modes.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-async.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-bulk.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-business-rule.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-concurrency.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-content-negotiation.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-call-invariant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-resource-chain.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-tenant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-endpoint.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-error-path.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-hie